<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="description" content="Personal profile — About me, projects, and contact." />
  <title>Bara Arkantara | Profile</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #fafafa;
      --fg: #1a1a2e;
      --muted: #6b7280;
      --accent: #2563eb;
      --accent-hover: #1d4ed8;
      --card: #ffffff;
      --border: #e5e7eb;
      --max-w: 720px;
      --space: 1.5rem;
    }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
          :root {
            --bg: #0f172a;
            --fg: #f1f5f9;
            --muted: #94a3b8;
            --accent: #3b82f6;
            --accent-hover: #60a5fa;
            --card: #1e293b;
            --border: #334155;
          }
          body {
            background-image: 
              radial-gradient(circle at 20% 80%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15) 0%, transparent 50%),
              radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%),
              linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg) 0%, var(--bg) 100%);
          }
        }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
          font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
          background: var(--bg);
          background-image: 
            radial-gradient(circle at 20% 80%, rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.15) 0%, transparent 50%),
            radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%),
            linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg) 0%, var(--bg) 100%);
          color: var(--fg);
          line-height: 1.6;
          min-height: 100vh;
          display: flex;
          flex-direction: column;
        }
    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: var(--max-w);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: calc(var(--space) * 3) var(--space);
    }
    header { margin-bottom: calc(var(--space) * 2); text-align: center; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .tagline { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.125rem; }
    .card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: calc(var(--space) * 1.5);
      margin-bottom: var(--space);
    }
    .card h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .card h2::before { content: ""; width: 4px; height: 1.25rem; background: var(--accent); border-radius: 2px; }
    .links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
    .link {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem; background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px; color: var(--fg); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.875rem;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    }
    .link:hover { border-color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent); color: white; }
    .link:hover svg { stroke: white; }
    .link svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; stroke: currentColor; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .gallery { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
    .gallery img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4/3; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border); transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; }
    .gallery img:hover { transform: scale(1.02); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
    .gallery a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }
    footer { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.875rem; padding: var(--space); margin-top: auto; }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .container { padding: calc(var(--space) * 2) 1rem; }
      .card { padding: var(--space); }
      .gallery { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>Your Name</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Student • Developer • Curious Builder</p>
    </header>

    <section class="card" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
      <h2 id="about-heading">About</h2>
      <p>Hi, I'm <strong>Your Name</strong> — a high school student at <strong>SMA Angkasa 1 Jakarta</strong> currently serving in OSIS (Student Council).</p>
      <p>I enjoy building things for the web, learning new frameworks, and solving problems with code. When I'm not coding, you'll find me reading, gaming, or hanging out with friends.</p>
      <p>Currently exploring: <strong>Astro</strong>, <strong>TypeScript</strong>, and modern CSS.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card" aria-labelledby="education-heading">
      <h2 id="education-heading">Education</h2>
      <p><strong>SMA Angkasa 1 Jakarta</strong> — High School Student (2024–Present)</p>
      <p>Active in OSIS: organizing events, managing student aspirations, and contributing to school community.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card" aria-labelledby="skills-heading">
      <h2 id="skills-heading">Skills</h2>
      <ul style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; list-style: none; margin-top: 0.5rem;">
        <li style="background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.875rem;">HTML / CSS</li>
        <li style="background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.875rem;">JavaScript / TypeScript</li>
        <li style="background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.875rem;">Astro</li>
        <li style="background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.875rem;">React (learning)</li>
        <li style="background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.875rem;">Git / GitHub</li>
        <li style="background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.875rem;">Tailwind CSS</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="card" aria-labelledby="photography-heading">
      <h2 id="photography-heading">Photography</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.9375rem;">Some shots I've taken — mostly street, architecture, and daily moments.</p>
      <div class="gallery" role="list">
              <!-- Replace these with your actual photos in public/photos/ -->
              <a href="/profile-site/photos/IMG_7688.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" role="listitem">
